{
    "title": "Fable: Books & TV",
    "description": "Join a community of good people discussing great stories on Fable, an app designed to find, discuss, and track books and TV shows. Connect with fellow bookworms and bingewatchers through book clubs and TV clubs, discover new books and shows, manage your TBR and other lists, set reading goals, track your progress, and discover a whole new kind of ebook reader.\r\n\r\nFOLLOW WHAT YOUR FRIENDS READ & WATCH: Curate your entertainment and literary life with a personalized feed of book and show recommendations, lists, ratings and reviews, news and trends, and more.\r\n- Follow friends, BookTokkers, TV recappers, authors, celebs, and other book and TV fans\r\n- Find and share meaningful quotes and memes about your favorite books and shows\r\n- Keep up with the latest trends in literature and television\r\n- Join the conversation about books and shows you\u2019re interested in\r\n- Connect with people who share your specific interests in books and TV shows through private DMs and group chats with up to 20 people\r\n\r\nJOIN BOOK CLUBS & TV CLUBS: Explore thousands of free book clubs and TV clubs for every niche interest, or start your own club to read and watch with friends, family, and colleagues.\r\n- Join your favorite BookTokkers\u2019 book clubs, or start a buddy read to discuss books with friends\r\n- Find clubs led by TV recappers and reviewers from TikTok, YouTube, and elsewhere \r\n- Spark conversations with your club in organized, spoiler-free chapter rooms and episode rooms\r\n\r\nORGANIZE YOUR LISTS: Manage your lists of everything you read and watch.\r\n- Organize the books and shows you\u2019re currently into, what\u2019s on your wishlist, and what you finished\r\n- Build custom lists for all of your niche book and TV interests\r\n- Follow lists from other readers and TV fans for inspiration, and share your own\r\n- Import your book lists from Goodreads and Kindle\r\n\r\nDISCOVER NEW BOOKS & SHOWS: Find your next favorite read or watch \r\n- Get personalized book and show recommendations based on what you like\r\n- Discover new books and shows from Fable\u2019s editorial team\r\n- Take our mood quiz to decide what to read next\r\n\r\nCREATE BETTER BOOK REVIEWS: Share your perspective with customized book ratings and book reviews.\r\n- Rate and review books, with the ability to leave half-stars\r\n- Add expressive tags to share exactly how the book made you feel\r\n- Pair your book review with emoji reactions for further customization\r\n- Leave book reviews in your book club\u2019s reflection room or on the book\u2019s detail page\r\n- See all your book reviews in one place by importing your lists from Goodreads\r\n- Share book reviews with other readers on Fable, with your book club, or on social media\r\n\r\nBUILD A READING HABIT, TRACK YOUR PROGRESS: Stay motivated with tools designed to help you tackle your reading goals.\r\n- Set annual reading goals to challenge yourself\r\n- Create daily reading streaks\r\n- Set reading reminders\r\n- Visualize your progress towards your goal on your profile\r\n- See customized charts and graphs about your reading habits\r\n- Get personalized insights about your reading life \r\n\r\nBUY EBOOKS DESIGNED FOR INTERACTIVE READING: Experience a new way to read books, on your own or with your book club, inside Fable\u2019s ebook reader.\r\n- Join other who are \u201csocial reading\u201d inside thousands of free book clubs\r\n- Annotate books with highlights, notes, comments, and reactions right inside the book\r\n- Mark key moments with private tabs\r\n- Respond to discussion prompts embedded inside the book\r\n- See how other readers are reacting to the book in real time \u2014 Fable\u2019s ebook reader integrates with your book club\u2019s chapter discussion rooms\r\n- Discover thousands of free books to read inside the Fable app, or shop from our catalog of over one million interactive ebooks\r\n\r\nSHOW OFF WHAT YOU READ\r\n- Create monthly Reading Wraps to highlight the books you read that month\r\n- Customize your Reading Wraps with themes and stickers that are uniquely you\r\n- Come back at the end of the year for an annual wrapup of your year in reading\r\n\r\nTerms of use: https://fable.co/terms",
    "descriptionHTML": "Join a community of good people discussing great stories on Fable, an app designed to find, discuss, and track books and TV shows. Connect with fellow bookworms and bingewatchers through book clubs and TV clubs, discover new books and shows, manage your TBR and other lists, set reading goals, track your progress, and discover a whole new kind of ebook reader.<br><br>FOLLOW WHAT YOUR FRIENDS READ &amp; WATCH: Curate your entertainment and literary life with a personalized feed of book and show recommendations, lists, ratings and reviews, news and trends, and more.<br>- Follow friends, BookTokkers, TV recappers, authors, celebs, and other book and TV fans<br>- Find and share meaningful quotes and memes about your favorite books and shows<br>- Keep up with the latest trends in literature and television<br>- Join the conversation about books and shows you\u2019re interested in<br>- Connect with people who share your specific interests in books and TV shows through private DMs and group chats with up to 20 people<br><br>JOIN BOOK CLUBS &amp; TV CLUBS: Explore thousands of free book clubs and TV clubs for every niche interest, or start your own club to read and watch with friends, family, and colleagues.<br>- Join your favorite BookTokkers\u2019 book clubs, or start a buddy read to discuss books with friends<br>- Find clubs led by TV recappers and reviewers from TikTok, YouTube, and elsewhere <br>- Spark conversations with your club in organized, spoiler-free chapter rooms and episode rooms<br><br>ORGANIZE YOUR LISTS: Manage your lists of everything you read and watch.<br>- Organize the books and shows you\u2019re currently into, what\u2019s on your wishlist, and what you finished<br>- Build custom lists for all of your niche book and TV interests<br>- Follow lists from other readers and TV fans for inspiration, and share your own<br>- Import your book lists from Goodreads and Kindle<br><br>DISCOVER NEW BOOKS &amp; SHOWS: Find your next favorite read or watch <br>- Get personalized book and show recommendations based on what you like<br>- Discover new books and shows from Fable\u2019s editorial team<br>- Take our mood quiz to decide what to read next<br><br>CREATE BETTER BOOK REVIEWS: Share your perspective with customized book ratings and book reviews.<br>- Rate and review books, with the ability to leave half-stars<br>- Add expressive tags to share exactly how the book made you feel<br>- Pair your book review with emoji reactions for further customization<br>- Leave book reviews in your book club\u2019s reflection room or on the book\u2019s detail page<br>- See all your book reviews in one place by importing your lists from Goodreads<br>- Share book reviews with other readers on Fable, with your book club, or on social media<br><br>BUILD A READING HABIT, TRACK YOUR PROGRESS: Stay motivated with tools designed to help you tackle your reading goals.<br>- Set annual reading goals to challenge yourself<br>- Create daily reading streaks<br>- Set reading reminders<br>- Visualize your progress towards your goal on your profile<br>- See customized charts and graphs about your reading habits<br>- Get personalized insights about your reading life <br><br>BUY EBOOKS DESIGNED FOR INTERACTIVE READING: Experience a new way to read books, on your own or with your book club, inside Fable\u2019s ebook reader.<br>- Join other who are \u201csocial reading\u201d inside thousands of free book clubs<br>- Annotate books with highlights, notes, comments, and reactions right inside the book<br>- Mark key moments with private tabs<br>- Respond to discussion prompts embedded inside the book<br>- See how other readers are reacting to the book in real time \u2014 Fable\u2019s ebook reader integrates with your book club\u2019s chapter discussion rooms<br>- Discover thousands of free books to read inside the Fable app, or shop from our catalog of over one million interactive ebooks<br><br>SHOW OFF WHAT YOU READ<br>- Create monthly Reading Wraps to highlight the books you read that month<br>- Customize your Reading Wraps with themes and stickers that are uniquely you<br>- Come back at the end of the year for an annual wrapup of your year in reading<br><br>Terms of use: https://fable.co/terms",
